Now fix index.js. It should read README.md and count "TODO" occurrences, output the number.

Let me write:

```js
const fs = require("fs");
const path = require("path");
const content = fs.readFileSync(path.join(__dirname, "README.md"), "utf8");
const count = (content.match(/TODO/g) || []).length;
console.log(count);
```

